### Area 2: tasks, an order's steps, the SPR approval page and reminders.
### Sign in first (auth.http). Every answer here is mock data and says so in
### meta.mock, except the document configuration. The POST requests write a real
### audit event and keep their result in a mock overlay, so the screens move on
### and Undo works. A restart forgets it, and an order's status never changes.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@csrf = paste the op_csrf cookie value here after signing in

### The caller's own task inbox (a role with an inbox). Filter with ?overdue=true, ?priority=high or ?kind=CONFIRM_PAYMENT.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/tasks?page=1&pageSize=25

### Another role's inbox. Needs workflows.inboxes.any (Management and Auditor).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/inboxes/WAREHOUSE/tasks

### Reminders, for the caller's role or another role's.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/reminders
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/inboxes/LOGISTICS/reminders

### An order's steps, timeline and payment. Sample orders are SO-0001 to SO-0120 and are dated from today.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/orders/SO-0004/flow

### Confirm a payment with its type. Finance only. The answer holds the paymentId that Undo takes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/orders/SO-0004/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "paymentType": "prepayment", "amount": "1250.00", "currencyCode": "USD", "reference": "TT-0004", "paidOn": "2026-11-02" }

### An SPR with its suggested fields, the stock figures and the approver's setup.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001

### Approve or reject with a comment. Approver only. Its task leaves the inbox.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "comment": "Within my limit." }

### A comment is required: this one is refused with VALIDATION_FAILED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001/reject
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{ "comment": "" }

### Undo a decision. It answers 404 when there is none to undo.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sprs/SPR-20261102-0001/undo
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Mark a task in the caller's own inbox as done. Copy an id from the inbox.
### Another role's task is refused and audited. An SPR, a payment or a field
### review answers 409: each is finished on its own screen.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/tasks/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/complete
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Undo a completed task.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/tasks/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/undo
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Undo a payment confirmation, with the paymentId its answer gave.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/orders/SO-0001/payments/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/undo
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### The rules waiting for Spectra to confirm, with their draft values. Needs settings.manage.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/open-rules

### Field settings and defaults for each document type, read from the table.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/document-config

### The SPRs the approval chain has handed to the caller, whatever their role. Real data.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/tasks/handed-to-me?page=1&pageSize=25

### The reminders and escalations sent to the caller or their role. Real data.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/reminders/for-me?page=1&pageSize=25

### The timing of each kind of task. Needs settings.manage.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sla-settings

### Change one kind of task's timing, in minutes. Needs settings.manage, and is audited.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/sla-settings/APPROVE_SPR
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "dueAfterMinutes": 1440,
  "remindBeforeMinutes": 240,
  "escalateAfterMinutes": 0,
  "escalateToRole": "MANAGEMENT"
}
